<title>HONG KONG: Denway Inv interim net loss HK$75.76 mln.</title>
<headline>Denway Inv interim net loss HK$75.76 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.74 loss  vs 4.43 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional item	   nil	  vs 29.15 profit</p>
<p>    Net			    75.76 loss vs 58.48 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     345.38     vs 455.23</p>
<p>    Company name		 Denway Investment Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>Note - Denway is involved in automobile manufacturing and trading primarily through its holding in Guangzhou Peugeot,.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
